1. Parties

"Licensor" means Ihan Hansaja, an individual based in Sri Lanka. "You" means the person or single legal entity that obtained
the license key and uses the Software.

2. What the Software is

BestOfBurst is a Windows application that analyses folders of photographs, groups
bursts and ranks the best frames. It runs on your computer. Your photographs are
never uploaded by the Software, and the Software never modifies, moves, renames or
deletes your original files.

